import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<LegalPage title="Returns & refunds" description="Returns for accessories, refunds and fit guarantee for digital files.">
  <h2>Accessories</h2>
  <p>Return policy for physical products to be defined with the fulfilment partners before the first accessory goes on sale (EU/UK buyers get at least the legal 14-day withdrawal right).</p>
  <h2>3D files: fit guarantee</h2>
  <p>If a file does not fit the vehicle and years it lists, email us within 30 days with a photo and we refund the purchase.</p>
  <h2>EU / UK right of withdrawal</h2>
  <p>At checkout you agree that the download starts immediately and acknowledge you lose the 14-day withdrawal right once the download begins. The fit guarantee still applies.</p>
  <h2>Print failures</h2>
  <p>Print problems caused by printer setup are not refundable, but we will help you dial it in.</p>
</LegalPage>
